#. うぅ…苗木…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ugh... Hey, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. へろへろだよ…
#. 私…へろへろなんだよね…
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm so tired..."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、へろへろみたいだね。
#. どうしたの？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, you *look* pretty tired. What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. 今朝、いつもより早く起きちゃったから、
#. 腕立てと腹筋とスクワットをやったんだけど…
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I woke up earlier than normal this morning, so I\n"
"decided to do a push-up, sit-up, squat set."
msgstr ""

#. …それぞれ１０００回ずつ。
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I ended up doing a thousand of each..."
msgstr ""

#. それで、へろへろに？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, that would explain it."
msgstr ""

#. へろへろ…へろへろ…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Tired...so tired..."
msgstr ""

#. 疲れた体が…甘い物を欲してるよ…
#. 例えば…
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I want...something sweet..."
msgstr ""

#. 小麦粉に砂糖やバターや卵を混ぜた生地を
#. 油で揚げた例の食べ物とか…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I want those things you get when you mix flour, sugar,\n"
"butter and eggs, then deep fry 'em..."
msgstr ""

#. ドーナツ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Donuts"
msgstr ""

#. クッキー
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr ""

#. それ、クッキーのこと？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You want some cookies?"
msgstr ""

#. 違うよ！
#. クッキーは油で揚げたりしないし！
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "No! Since when do you deep fry a cookie!?"
msgstr ""

#. クッキーも嫌いじゃないけど…
#. あまり食べた気にならないんだよね～。
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I mean, don't get me wrong. I like cookies as much as\n"
"anyone. But they're totally not filling..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱりこう、食べたときに
#. 胃にどっしり来る物がいいよね！
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"When you're as tired as I am, you want something\n"
"that'll leave ya feeling full and gross!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女の子の発言には聞こえない気が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if any girl in the history of human\n"
"civilization has ever said something like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. チュロス
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Churros"
msgstr ""

#. チュロスかな？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you talking about churros?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、チュロスもいいよね！
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh man, churros are good, too!"
msgstr ""

#. 外はカリッと、中はもっちりってところは
#. 例の食べ物と一緒だし！
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Crunchy on the outside, chewy on the inside... It's\n"
"almost the same as what I'm craving!"
msgstr ""

#. っていうか、
#. 多分、同じカテゴリなんじゃないかな？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I guess you could probably put them in the same\n"
"category, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>チュロスと同じカテゴリの、例の食べ物…か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh... So it's something similar to churros...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、わかんないの！？
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Haven't you figured it out, Makoto!?"
msgstr ""

#. 小麦粉に砂糖やバターや卵を混ぜた生地を
#. 油で揚げた例の食べ物だよ！　ほら！
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Flour, sugar, butter, eggs, then fry it! Come on!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、朝日奈さんが言ってるのって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So what Hina's looking for is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. わかった、ドーナツでしょ？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, I know. You want some donuts, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね、内緒の話なんだけど、
#. 寄宿舎の倉庫に<CLT 3>冷凍ドーナツ<CLT>があるんだ…
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone, but there's actually a bunch of\n"
"<CLT 3>frozen donuts<CLT> in the warehouse...!"
msgstr ""

#. それを電子レンジに入れた時の事を
#. 想像してみなって！
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Throw those in the microwave for a few seconds and\n"
"just imagine..."
msgstr ""

#. ほっかほかのドーナツを想像してみなって！
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Imagine the warm chewiness of that donut!"
msgstr ""

#. ほら、食べたくなったでしょ！？
#. 苗木もドーナツ食べたくなったでしょ！？
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You know what I'm saying, right? You'd eat the crap\n"
"outta that, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に好きなんだね、ドーナツ…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You really do love donuts, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. むしろ嫌いな人なんている！？
#. 全世界…いや<CLT 3>全宇宙<CLT>が好きでしょ！
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Is there anyone who doesn't? Who on Earth—no, who in\n"
"the <CLT 3>whole universe<CLT> can say they hate donuts!?"
msgstr ""

#. あのね、ドーナツを食べるとね…
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Think about the sensation of biting into a donut..."
msgstr ""

#. 甘い砂糖の味が口中に広がって、
#. 次にもちっとした生地の食感が…
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"First the sweetness floods your mouth, then the soft\n"
"dough cushions you..."
msgstr ""

#. そんで、卵とバターの風味が口に
#. ぶわぁーっと広がった途端…
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Next you get that hint of egg and butter, right?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか、体がとろろ～んって、
#. とろけてくるんだよ…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Your whole body starts to melt..."
msgstr ""

#. まるで自分がドーナツの穴の中に落ちていくような、
#. そんな素敵な感覚…
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You feel like you're falling into the center of the\n"
"donut itself!"
msgstr ""

#. これを、<CLT 3>ドーナツ化現象<CLT>って言うらしいよ。
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"When people talk about the <CLT 3>donut effective<CLT>, that's\n"
"what they're talking about...!"
msgstr ""

#. …いや、ウソだよ。
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's absolutely not true."
msgstr ""

#. ああっ、ダメだ…！
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ahh, I can't take it anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. もう…ガマン出来ない…
#. ヨダレがナイアガラ状態だよ…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm drooling like Niagara Falls over here!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木！　そこをどいて！
#. ジャマすると、グーでいくよ！
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Get outta my way, Makoto, or I got an uppercut with\n"
"your name on it!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…ジャマなんて…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I'm not in the way..."
msgstr ""

#. …待っててね！　ドーナツの神様！！
msgctxt "0044 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait for me, god of donuts!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言い終わるや否や、
#. 朝日奈さんは猛スピードで駆けていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Almost before she was done talking, Hina took off like\n"
"a bat out of hell...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんと接してると…
#. なんて言うか、人間の生命力みたいなものを感じるな…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Whenever I'm around her, I feel like I'm soaking in\n"
"the essence of human vitality..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>朝日奈葵の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hina's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>走り去った朝日奈さんを見送った後、
#. ボクは自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After I watched her run off, I went back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
